## State Table

| Current State |  Condition  | Next State |
|---------------|-------------|------------|
| IDLE          | Call Button | MOVING_UP  |
| MOVING_UP     | Arrived     | DOOR_OPEN  |
| DOOR_OPEN     | Timer Done  | DOOR_CLOSE |
| DOOR_CLOSE    | Complete    | IDLE       |

